From cfb50dfcb284b7ed2d589c41fdf7fd9b0897c210 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TuNV <tunguyenvanbn94@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 15:35:44 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] [icwmp feed] DEPENDS must carry zlib: the binary links -lz
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

  Package icwmp_tr098 is missing dependencies for the following libraries:
  libz.so.1

Compile and link both succeeded; ipkg-build is what refused.  bin/Makefile.am
puts $(LIBZ_LIBS) on icwmp_tr098d_LDADD for zlib.c (SOAP compression), which
the cwmpclient package this replaces never linked -- so the dependency is new
rather than dropped, and nothing in the DEPENDS line covered it.

Also added +libubox.  The binary NEEDs libubox.so directly; it is installed
anyway as a dependency of libblobmsg-json (same source package), which is why
ipkg-build never complained.  libtr098 lists it explicitly and this package
now does too.

-lcrypto and -lssl stay out on purpose: they are on the link line but nothing
here calls OpenSSL (curl does), so --as-needed drops them and the ELF has no
NEEDED entry.  Adding +libopenssl would pull openssl into the image for no
reason.

check-pkg-deps.py compares <target>_LDADD against DEPENDS, resolving each -l to
its OpenWrt package by searching the SDK tree for the Makefile that installs
lib<x>.so, rather than a hand-written table.  On the pre-fix Makefile it
reports exactly "-lz -> cần +zlib".

NOT BUILD-TESTED on this host: no compiler here.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 release/feeds/icwmp_tr098/Makefile | 11 ++++++++++-
 1 file changed, 10 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/release/feeds/icwmp_tr098/Makefile b/release/feeds/icwmp_tr098/Makefile
index d54cc14..709d896 100644
--- a/release/feeds/icwmp_tr098/Makefile
+++ b/release/feeds/icwmp_tr098/Makefile
@@ -29,7 +29,16 @@ define Package/icwmp_tr098
   CATEGORY:=Utilities
   SUBMENU:=TRx69
   TITLE:=TR069 CWMP client (icwmp + libtr098, replaces cwmpclient)
-  DEPENDS:=+libubus +libuci +libcurl +libmicroxml +libjson-c +libblobmsg-json +libpthread +libtr098
+  # +zlib: bin/Makefile.am links icwmp_tr098d with $(LIBZ_LIBS) for zlib.c (SOAP
+  # compression).  The cwmpclient package this replaces never linked it, so the
+  # dependency is new -- without it ipkg-build fails with "missing dependencies
+  # for the following libraries: libz.so.1".
+  # +libubox: the binary NEEDs libubox.so directly.  It happens to be installed
+  # anyway as a dependency of libblobmsg-json (same source package), which is
+  # why ipkg-build never complained -- libtr098 lists it explicitly and so does
+  # this now.  -lcrypto/-lssl are on the link line too but --as-needed drops
+  # them: nothing here calls OpenSSL, curl does, so no +libopenssl.
+  DEPENDS:=+libubus +libuci +libubox +libcurl +libmicroxml +libjson-c +libblobmsg-json +libpthread +zlib +libtr098
   CONFLICTS:=cwmpclient
 endef
 
